        "content": [
          "To begin the process for WIGGO, start by placing an Order",
          "Check the Customer's Credit Limit",
          "If the response",
          "is \"Okay\"",
          "proceed to Check the Availability of the Article",
          "After checking the availability, if the response is \"Okay\", proceed to Check the Availability of the Article again. If the response is \"No\", send a Denial to the Customer.",
          "If the Article",
          "is not available",
          "proceed to Produce the Goods",
          "After checking the availability of the Article, send an Order Confirmation.",
          "Simultaneously, complete the following steps: Ship the Goods and Send the Invoice.",
          "Check the Payment status.",
          "If the payment",
          "has been received",
          "close the Order",
          "end the process."
        ]
      },
